  "task_html": "<div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Schnittpunkt rechnerisch bestimmen</div><p style='font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 12px;'>Zwei Geraden schneiden sich dort, wo beide Funktionen denselben y-Wert haben &ndash; also wo f(x) = g(x) gilt. Diese Gleichung l&ouml;st man nach x auf, dann berechnet man y.</p><div style='background:#1C1B1F;color:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;line-height:2;margin-bottom:12px;'><strong>Vorgehen:</strong><br>&#x2460;&nbsp;f(x) = g(x) setzen und nach x aufl&ouml;sen<br>&#x2461;&nbsp;x in eine der Gleichungen einsetzen &rarr; y berechnen<br>&#x2462;&nbsp;Schnittpunkt aufschreiben: S(x|y)</div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1.5px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;font-size:13px;'><strong>Beispiel:</strong>&nbsp;f(x) = 2x &minus; 1 &nbsp;und&nbsp; g(x) = &minus;x + 5<br><span style='font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:2.2;display:block;'>&#x2460; 2x &minus; 1 = &minus;x + 5 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; 3x = 6 &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; x = 2<br>&#x2461; y = 2&middot;2 &minus; 1 = 3<br>&#x2462; S(2|3)</span></div></div><div class='task-block task-green'><div class='task-block-label'>Aufgaben &ndash; Bestimme S rechnerisch</div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:12px;margin:10px 0;'><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px;'>a)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>f(x) = x + 2 &nbsp;&nbsp;und&nbsp;&nbsp; g(x) = &minus;x + 6</p><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;'><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>S(&nbsp;x&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='2' placeholder='?' style='width:60px;text-align:center;'></label><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>y&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='4' placeholder='?' style='width:60px;text-align:center;'>)</label></div></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px;'>b)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>f(x) = 2x &nbsp;&nbsp;und&nbsp;&nbsp; g(x) = x + 3</p><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;'><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>S(&nbsp;x&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='3' placeholder='?' style='width:60px;text-align:center;'></label><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>y&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='6' placeholder='?' style='width:60px;text-align:center;'>)</label></div></div><div style='background:#fff;border:1px solid #e8eaed;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;'><p style='font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0 0 6px;'>c)</p><p style='font-size:14px;margin:0 0 10px;'>f(x) = 3x &minus; 1 &nbsp;&nbsp;und&nbsp;&nbsp; g(x) = x + 3</p><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;align-items:center;'><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>S(&nbsp;x&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='2' placeholder='?' style='width:60px;text-align:center;'></label><label style='font-size:13px;font-weight:500;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;'>y&nbsp;=<input class='cell-input' data-ans='5' placeholder='?' style='width:60px;text-align:center;'>)</label></div></div></div><div class='check-bar'><button class='btn-check' onclick='checkStation(17)'>&#x2713; &Uuml;berpr&uuml;fen</button><button class='btn-reset' onclick='resetStation(17)'>&#x21BA; Zur&uuml;cksetzen</button><span class='check-result' id='check-result-17'></span></div></div>",
  "sol_html": "<div style='font-family:monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:2.1;'>a)&nbsp; x + 2 = &minus;x + 6<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2x = 4<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;x = 2 &nbsp;|&nbsp; y = 2+2 = 4 &nbsp;&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; <strong>S(2|4)</strong><br><br>b)&nbsp; 2x = x + 3<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;x = 3 &nbsp;|&nbsp; y = 2&middot;3 = 6 &nbsp;&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; <strong>S(3|6)</strong><br><br>c)&nbsp; 3x &minus; 1 = x + 3<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2x &minus; 1 = 3<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2x = 4<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;x = 2 &nbsp;|&nbsp; y = 3&middot;2&minus;1 = 5 &nbsp;&nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; <strong>S(2|5)</strong></div>"
}
